{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10533","headline":"同朱五题卢使君义井 · 高适","name":"同朱五题卢使君义井","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高义唯良牧，深仁自下车。\n宁知凿井处，还是饮冰余。\n地即泉源久，人当汲引初。\n体清能鉴物，色洞每含虚。\n上善滋来往，中和浃里闾。\n济时应未竭，怀惠复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}